  "body": "Krantenwijk 0.11.0 for Android 12 and newer.\n\n**Install or update:** download `krantenwijk-0.11.0.apk` on your phone and open it. Your route and settings are kept.\n\n### Changes\n- REL-B: GitHub Release workflow\n- DATA-A: backup and restore; minSdk 31 (DEC-027)\n- App icon: mailbox (DEC-025)\n- ONB-A: setup wizard and home screen\n- RND-A/B/D: round mode street by street, touch targets, screen tests\n- ADR-C: change walking direction afterwards\n- BLD-B: apartment grid with bulk edit\n- BLD-A: create apartment buildings\n- DEC-017/018/019: round and section-order decisions\n- STK-A: stickers per address with bulk edit\n- ADR-B: number check and address editing\n- ADR-A: add street section with live preview\n- FND-002: theme, navigation, settings\n- CI: test summary on the run page\n- FND-004: KMP core module, Room schema v1, repositories\n- FND-003: domain rules with unit tests\n- FND-001: record release signing setup\n- FND-001: Android project skeleton, build and CI\n- Set up Krantenwijk project: boilerplate, domain memory, spec\n- Initial commit\n\n---\nversionCode: 12\nsha256: f7613508180cb85d239ed93d1b53b6bc35dabc2585a890173150b163c9cf9a0c\n"
